&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; morsure, +6 (1d8+6 plus poison)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Espace&lt;/b&gt; 3 m (2 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;) ; &lt;b&gt;Allonge&lt;/b&gt; 1,5 m (1 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Attaque sp&#233;ciales&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Toile-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Toile&quot;&gt;toile&lt;/a&gt; (+4 &#224; distance, DD 19, 5 pv)
&lt;/div&gt;
